the expression\n\n$$\nx=n\\cdot {180}^{∘},\n$$\n\nwhere $n$ is an integer.\n\nTo find the asymptotes of $2\\operatorname{cot}⁡(3x)-5,$ we replace the $x$ on the left-hand side of the above with $(3x).$ This gives\n\n$$\n3x=n\\cdot {180}^{∘}.\n$$\n\nSolving for $x,$ we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3x & =n\\cdot {180}^{∘} \\\\ x & =\\frac{n\\cdot {180}^{∘}}{3} \\\\ x & =n\\cdot {60}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that the expression giving all the vertical asymptotes is $x=n\\cdot {60}^{∘},$ where $n$ is an integer." 13194139534599 true] [17592186298046 1000 #edb/ref 17592186298047 13194139534599 true] [17592186298046 1000 #edb/ref 17592186298048 13194139534599 true] [17592186298046 1000 #edb/ref 17592186298049 13194139534599 true] [17592186298046 1000 #edb/ref 17592186298050 13194139534599 true] [17592186298046 1000 #edb/ref 17592186298051 13194139534599 true] [17592186298046 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534599 true] [17592186298046 1041 "selection" 13194139534599 true] [17592186298046 1104 #edb/ref 17592186298050 13194139534599 true] [17592186298046 1110 #uuid "326f65af-853f-53ab-b946-691e77e8e9c3" 13194139534599 true] [17592186298047 1034 "x=n\\cdot {20}^{∘}" 13194139534599 true] [17592186298047 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534599 true] [17592186298047 1111 #uuid "c304d38a-90f7-55a2-a2b3-33d7f56dff5b" 13194139534599 true] [17592186298048 1034 "x=n\\cdot {90}^{∘}" 13194139534599 true] [17592186298048 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534599 true] [17592186298048 1111 #uuid "84b3de38-e256-5be9-9141-50e39363e94a" 13194139534599 true] [17592186298049 1034 "x=n\\cdot {120}^{∘}" 13194139534599 true] [17592186298049 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534599 true] [17592186298049 1111 #uuid "5510104d-4aa9-58bd-8ec4-82ffead66336" 13194139534599 true] [17592186298050 1034 "x=n\\cdot {60}^{∘}" 13194139534599 true] [17592186298050 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534599 true] [17592186298050 1111 #uuid "d2ecf322-9542-5259-ab3b-3fc70cc9